# Cloudflare Pages SPA deep-link fallback — SCOPED to the real client routes
# only. Listing the actual app routes (instead of a blanket /* catch-all) means
# any other unknown path — stale /drkyana/* links, typos, scanners — returns
# Cloudflare Pages' default 404 rather than a soft-200 with the app shell, which
# is better SEO hygiene. The root (/) is served by the index.html asset directly;
# Pages Functions (functions/api/*) and real static assets are matched before
# these rules. Add a line here when you add a new client route.
/receptionist  /index.html  200
/account       /index.html  200
